    "title": "Infinity™ DBS Neurostimulator",
    "description": "The Infinity DBS (Deep Brain Stimulation) device is an implantable medical device providing Neurostimulation.  DBS therapies can help stabilize the brain signals that cause involuntary movements due to Parkinson’s disease or essential tremor.\nThe System is controlled through Apple mobile digital devices and Bluetooth® wireless technology.\nMy contribution to this project was to help design and develop the firmware that exists on the implantable medical device.",
    "dateRange": {},
    "associatedWith": "Jan 2017 - Jan 2018"
