   {
    "title": "Proclaim™ DRG Neurostimulator System",
    "description": "The Proclaim DRG device is an implantable device providing Neurostimulation.  Dorsal root ganglion (DRG) therapy is a non-opiod therapy designed to manage difficult-to-treat chronic pain in specific areas of the lower body, such as the foot, knee, or groin.  Proclaim™ DRG Neurostimulator System can provide therapy to aid in treatment of chronic pain.\nMy contribution to this project was to help design and develop the firmware that exists on the implantable medical device.",
